{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7KiiQDAjFTbC6y6Y7yU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can help. A few questions first, because the answers change what the summary can safely claim:\n\n1. **How will you cover the other $33,000 a year?** The attorney costs $78,000 and the foundation's maximum is $45,000. Reviewers will spot that right away. Do you have the rest committed or pending (county money, another grant, reserves)? If none of it is secured yet, should I say that plainly?\n\n2. **Is the attorney leaving in June being replaced separately?** If not, a \"third attorney\" would really keep you at two, and the foundation might see the request as backfilling a vacancy rather than adding capacity. Is there a replacement plan, and when exactly does the new hire start?\n\n3. **What can you commit to in numbers?** For example, how many more tenants per year a third attorney would represent (roughly 80 open cases at once, but how many closed per year?), and whether you'd track outcomes the same way. A specific target will help the application more than anything else.\n\n4. **How solid is the county contract?** Has the county said anything about renewing the $60,000 in October, good or bad? It's a risk the foundation may already know about, so I'd rather address it than leave it out.\n\n5. **Who reads this, and what do they already know about you?** Have you had foundation funding before, and if so, what did you report? Do you have any outside support, like a judge, the court clerk, or a partner agency who sends you referrals?\n\n6. **Is there anything else the reviewers might already know or will find out?** For example, a weak number, a past grant that fell short, or turnover. And what's the clinic's name and the submission deadline?\n\nIf you don't know some of these, that's fine. I'll write around them without guessing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":618,"cache_read_input_tokens":9572,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":618},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48f96ee9-8d90-4566-a1e9-383e898013b2","uuid":"191dc768-9d7a-4cca-8bb7-376733eea083","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:33:31.688Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7KiiH2NbbiWtZKK7wEH"}
